{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2021-12-09 07:00:00', 'title': 'GARMIN G3000 INTEGRATED FLIGHT DECK SELECTED BY HEART AEROSPACE FOR THE FIRST ALL-ELECTRIC ES-19 AIRLINER', 'text': 'OLATHE, KAN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GARMIN® INTERNATIONAL, INC., A UNIT OF GARMIN LTD. (NYSE: GRMN), TODAY ANNOUNCED A LONG-TERM AGREEMENT WITH HEART AEROSPACE TO PROVIDE THE STATE-OF-THE-ART GARMIN G3000® INTEGRATED FLIGHT DECK FOR THE ES-19 ELECTRIC AIRLINER. HEART AEROSPACE IS WORKING TO DEVELOP THE NEW ES-19, A 19-SEAT ELECTRIC AIRLINER THAT HAS THE POTENTIAL TO PROVIDE THE REGIONAL AIR TRANSPORT MARKET WITH A MORE SUSTAINABLE AND ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY AIRCRAFT OPTION AS EARLY AS 2026. ADDITI'}